  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d12f67820ba484488a4e5e3be56da97e, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Desalination Technologies Institute: This institute is devoted
    to the securing of fresh water supplies through advancing desalination technologies.
    Its focus areas include improving desalination efficiency (e.g. new membranes
    for reverse osmosis), reducing energy consumption of desalination plants, and
    developing alternative methods like thermal, solar, or advanced filtration desalination.
    The institute\u2019s mission supports Saudi Arabia\u2019s water strategy by making
    seawater and brackish water desalination more sustainable and cost-effective.
    Research also covers brine management and minimizing the environmental impact
    of desalination processes"
